<title>UK: Prism Rail sets rights issue with interims.</title>
<headline>Prism Rail sets rights issue with interims.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending August 17</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.78 loss	    vs n/a</p>
<p>Pretax		     0.336 loss	   vs n/a</p>
<p> Turnover		   19.67		  vs n/a</p>
<p>Full company name - Prism Rail Plc</p>
<p>Note - Rail service operator Prism Rail was floated on London's Alternative Investment Market on May 29. It did not give year-earlier comparisons for its results.</p>
<p>It announced a five for 28 rights issue at 330 pence per share to raise 11.2 million stg.</p>
<p>It gave the following results for the period February 1 to October 12.</p>
<p>			     (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.12 loss	   vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     0.549		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Turnover		   32.797		 vs n/a</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
